# Retired scene-pack releases (Cloudflare Pages redirects, developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/).
# Each release below was served in production and was then replaced; its files keep their names under the current
# release, so a crawled or linked URL (licences, notices, pack files) moves permanently to the same file there.
# validate-static checks every rule: no built file under a retired prefix, and files under each target prefix.
# When a scene pack moves to a new release, point its earlier rules at the new one and add one for the release retired.
/scene-packs/golden-gate/g9/* /scene-packs/golden-gate/g9-code6/:splat 301
/scene-packs/golden-gate/g9-code5/* /scene-packs/golden-gate/g9-code6/:splat 301
/scene-packs/foundry-floor/ff3-review2/* /scene-packs/foundry-floor/ff3-review2-code5/:splat 301
/scene-packs/troy/troy-20261005-04/* /scene-packs/troy/troy-20261005-07/:splat 301
/scene-packs/troy/troy-20261005-06/* /scene-packs/troy/troy-20261005-07/:splat 301
